{
  "$comment": "Fetal movement log (lib/pregnancy/movements): her latest session's minutes per movement against the median of her earlier ones (newest first). Flags a change at 1.5x; never says a session was fine (rule 1, ADR-049). Ratios rounded to 4 decimal places.",
